# 0239 = 0238 + full QMU restart when a queue stays inactive.  Node
#   restart showed only a full endpoint re-program revives a dry queue;
#   RESUME alone never did.  Re-program TX1/RX1 CSR+QCR and START from the
#   oldest unprocessed GPD (20 ms rate limit).  Also fix RX EP reset to
#   EP1 OUT (BIT(1)); RX2 was being reset instead.
